## Multi-tenancy
## Base domain tenant subdomains hang off in production, e.g. hms.example.com
## so that acme.hms.example.com resolves to tenant "acme". Leave blank in
## development: the API and the app are on different origins locally, so the
## tenant arrives in the header below instead.
TENANT_BASE_DOMAIN=
TENANT_HEADER_NAME=X-Tenant